('headset check','Still open. Native standing and closer console photographs, plus actual readout strings, are provided in intro/. These cannot establish legibility in a headset without leaning. Kept the existing adapters unchanged. A headset walk must read both consoles before deciding whether fewer figures or larger type is needed.','open','comment'),
