('supporting works','Added an optional return to the existing three-rule pump, frame-sampled staircase, gutter boats and swaying marble bowl. Amended the suggested sentence to avoid calling all of them clock-driven. Four selected comparisons orient the reader without replacing the three main encounters with an inventory.','done','fix'),
('clarity','Changed the Riemann opening to the same curve, so the paragraph can stand alone without a dangling it.','done','fix'),
