('source correction','Added the moving puck and turning arrow across the hall, but amended the review’s proposed speed claim. velocity_arrow.gd estimates change per track angle, scales and clamps its magnitude, and does not multiply by the speed parameter. The clock advances the puck. The new sentence describes that distinction without falsely equating arrow length with speed. Source unchanged; calibration remains possible future artifact work.','done','fix'),
